OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife habitat planned on more
OL,4,Athan 120 acres
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 120 acres of land in
OL,7,FDerbyshire is set to be converted into
OL,8,Fa wildlife habitat as part of a nature
OL,9,Fdiscovery scheme.
OL,11,FEcological firm Environment Bank said
OL,12,Fthe site near Newton Solney, along the
OL,13,FRiver Trent, would be restored to
OL,14,Fcreate meadows, grassland, woodland and
OL,15,Fhedgerows.
OL,17,FThe project also aims to improve links
OL,18,Fbetween existing wildlife habitats,
OL,19,Fincluding areas near the Melbourne
OL,20,FRailway Local Wildlife Site.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
